  "Financial settings are read-only": { "Türkçe": "Finansal ayarlar salt okunur", "Deutsch": "Finanzeinstellungen sind schreibgeschützt", "Français": "Les paramètres financiers sont en lecture seule", "Italiano": "Le impostazioni finanziarie sono di sola lettura", "Español (Spanish)": "Los ajustes financieros son de solo lectura", "Português": "As definições financeiras são só de leitura", "Русский (Russian)": "Финансовые настройки доступны только для чтения", "日本語 (Japanese)": "財務設定は閲覧のみです", "中文 (Chinese)": "财务设置为只读", "العربية (Arabic)": "الإعدادات المالية للقراءة فقط", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "वित्तीय सेटिंग्स केवल पढ़ने के लिए हैं" },
